{"id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-partial-isomorphism.md","title":"Partial Isomorphism","display":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","aliases":["57-df-partial-isomorphism"],"display":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-partial-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-partial-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为候选部分函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\operatorname{dom}(p)\">\\(A_0=\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0=\\operatorname{ran}(p)\">\\(B_0=\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(\\vec a)\">\\(p(\\vec a)\\)</span> 按分量施加。符号与元数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。保留原定义对函数解释的定义域封闭条件，以及仅在常量值已进入定义域时要求保持常量的条件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(p,A,B)\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A_0\\;(p(a)=p(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}\\in A_0\\to p(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A_0^n\\;\n(\\vec a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow p(\\vec a)\\in R^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A_0^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a)\\in A_0\\land p(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(p(\\vec a))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\subseteq A\\times B:\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(p,A,B)\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A_0\\;(p(a)=p(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}\\in A_0\\to p(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A_0^n\\;\n(\\vec a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow p(\\vec a)\\in R^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A_0^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a)\\in A_0\\land p(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(p(\\vec a))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p\\subseteq A\\times B:\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原来的较强部分同构约定，没有因其不常见而删除函数封闭条件。对一般函数语言，不应直接把任意有限元组对应当作这种封闭部分同构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$p$ 为候选部分函数图，$A_0=\\operatorname{dom}(p)$、$B_0=\\operatorname{ran}(p)$，见 [[57-df-partial-function]]；$p(\\vec a)$ 按分量施加。符号与元数见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。保留原定义对函数解释的定义域封闭条件，以及仅在常量值已进入定义域时要求保持常量的条件。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$p$ 为候选部分函数图，$A_0=\\operatorname{dom}(p)$、$B_0=\\operatorname{ran}(p)$，见 [[57-df-partial-function]]；$p(\\vec a)$ 按分量施加。符号与元数见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。保留原定义对函数解释的定义域封闭条件，以及仅在常量值已进入定义域时要求保持常量的条件。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$p$ 为候选部分函数图，$A_0=\\operatorname{dom}(p)$、$B_0=\\operatorname{ran}(p)$，见 [[57-df-partial-function]]；$p(\\vec a)$ 按分量施加。符号与元数见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。保留原定义对函数解释的定义域封闭条件，以及仅在常量值已进入定义域时要求保持常量的条件。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A_0=\\operatorname{dom}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"B_0=\\operatorname{ran}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p(\\vec a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(p,A,B)\\land\\forall a,a'\\in A_0\\;(p(a)=p(a')\\to a=a')\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak A}\\in A_0\\to p(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A_0^n\\;\n(\\vec a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow p(\\vec a)\\in R^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A_0^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a)\\in A_0\\land p(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(p(\\vec a))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)&\\coloneqq\\{p\\subseteq A\\times B:\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1884,"backlinks":[{"id":"5ef176a8d804d79a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 是同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。固定 $p\\in\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]。本文件保留原单向一步扩展谓词；反向扩展须对逆映射另行调用，不能从其名称推得。"},{"id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件的游戏与 $\\equiv_n$ 等价式使用有限纯关系签名：$\\mathrm{Const}_S=\\emptyset$、$\\mathrm{Func}_S^k=\\emptyset$ 对所有 $k\\geq1$，且 $\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^k$ 有限；见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。这保证 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]] 的封闭约定对有限位置无额外函数约束，也保证有限秩类型只有有限多个。"},{"id":"b82abcee4938fc49","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"983eb8fcfa54aec4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系签名条件，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 为同签名结构，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$\\mathrm{PartIso}$、原单向 $\\mathrm{BackAndForth}$、$\\equiv$ 见 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]、[[57-df-back-and-forth]]、[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]。$\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[57-df-finite]]；$\\mathcal I$ 是按剩余步数分层的部分同构族，$p^{-1}=\\{\\langle b,a\\rangle:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in p\\}$。"},{"id":"86d2ffc4d9622936","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d4e38b5fc56856c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为至多可数的纯关系语言，$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$x,y_1,y_2,\\ldots$ 互异。$\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]$ 使用 [[57-df-satisfaction]] 的显式变量列参数接口。$\\mathrm{PartIso}$ 保持 [[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]；$[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}$ 表示有限子集。下面定义 $\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega$、$\\mathrm{Forth}$、$\\mathrm{Back}$；定理假定 $\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak A)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak B)$。"},{"id":"b430b63369811858","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contr